# The fly-through's second sample model, a large spider, drawn as text. Regenerate spider.vox with
#   cargo run -p vxe-assets --example voxtext -- to-vox spider.voxtext spider.vox
# Fourteen models: the body, the abdomen, eight legs, two palps and two fangs (spider.rig places
# them). Layers run from the bottom up (z is up); in a layer the first row is the back (largest
# y) and the last row the front (y 0), which the spider faces. Each colour's index is a row of
# spider.rig's material map: s shell, u rubble, k rock, o ore, c crystal, a amethyst, e ember,
# w walker, y walker_eye.
color s 1 31 31 36
color u 2 92 84 77
color k 3 107 97 87
color o 4 255 140 40
color c 5 90 200 220
color a 6 150 70 200
color e 7 200 40 20
color w 8 140 133 122
color y 9 230 180 100
model body at 0 0 40
